{"speciesId":636,"names":{"fr":"Pyronille","es":"Larvesta","en":"Larvesta","ja":"メラルバ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On dit que ce Pokémon serait né du soleil. Lorsqu’il évolue, tout son corps est enveloppé de flammes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"This Pokémon was believed to have been born from the sun. When it evolves, its entire body is engulfed in flames."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il vit au pied des volcans. Il repousse ceux qui l’attaquent avec les flammes qui jaillissent de ses cinq cornes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The base of volcanoes is where they make their homes. They shoot fire from their five horns to repel attacking enemies."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Said to have been born from the sun, it spews fire from its horns and encases itself in a cocoon of fire when it evolves."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Said to have been born from the sun, it spews fire from its horns and encases itself in a cocoon of fire when it evolves."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"On dit que ce Pokémon serait né du soleil. Il évolue en enveloppant son corps des flammes qui jaillissent de ses cornes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se dice que nació del sol. Al evolucionar, cubre su cuerpo con llamas que brotan de sus cuernos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Said to have been born from the sun, it spews fire from its horns and encases itself in a cocoon of fire when it evolves."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"太陽から 生まれたと いわれる。 進化するとき ツノから 噴き出した 炎で 全身を 包みこむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vit au pied des volcans. Il repousse ceux qui l’attaquent avec les flammes qui jaillissent de ses cinq cornes."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vive en las laderas de los volcanes. Emite fuego por sus cinco cuernos para ahuyentar a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The base of volcanoes is where they make their homes. They shoot fire from their five horns to repel attacking enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"火山の ふもとに 生息する。 ５本の ツノから 炎を 出して 襲ってきた 敵を 撃退する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On dit que ce Pokémon serait né du soleil. Il évolue en enveloppant son corps des flammes qui jaillissent de ses cornes."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se dice que nació del sol. Al evolucionar, cubre su cuerpo con llamas que brotan de sus cuernos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Said to have been born from the sun, it spews fire from its horns and encases itself in a cocoon of fire when it evolves."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"太陽から 生まれたと いわれる。 進化するとき ツノから 噴き出した 炎で 全身を 包みこむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il vit au pied des volcans. Il repousse ceux qui l’attaquent avec les flammes qui jaillissent de ses cinq cornes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vive en las laderas de los volcanes. Emite fuego por sus cinco cuernos para ahuyentar a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The base of volcanoes is where they make their homes. They shoot fire from their five horns to repel attacking enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"火山の ふもとに 生息する。 ５本の ツノから 炎を 出して 襲ってきた 敵を 撃退する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il se bat en projetant des flammes par ses cinq cornes. Ces gerbes de feu dévastatrices peuvent atteindre les 3 000 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cuando ha de enfrentarse a un rival, expulsa a través de los cinco cuernos llamaradas que llegan a alcanzar temperaturas de 3000 ºC."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"When battling opponents, it sprays fire from its five horns. The max temperature of the flames can reach nearly 5,500 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"５本のツノから 炎を 吹きだし 相手と 戦う。 その温度は 最大で ３０００度に 達する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il se sert de flammes pour se défendre. Jadis, les anciens pensaient qu’il nichait dans le soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Utiliza las llamas para defenderse. La gente de épocas pasadas tenía la creencia de que anidaba en el propio sol."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It protects itself with flame. Long years ago, people believed Larvesta had a nest on the sun."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"炎を 使って 身を 守る。 昔の 人々は 太陽に 巣が あると 信じていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il y a fort longtemps, les gens croyaient que les Pyronille étaient tombés du soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Antaño se creía que este Pokémon provenía del mismísimo sol."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The people of ancient times believed that Larvesta fell from the sun."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"はるか 昔の 人々は メラルバは 太陽から 落っこちてきたと 信じていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"La température de son corps est très élevée. Il projette des flammes du bout de ses cornes pour intimider ses ennemis et ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su cuerpo es cálido. Expulsa llamaradas por los cuernos con el fin de intimidar a sus enemigos y presas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Larvesta’s body is warm all over. It spouts fire from the tips of its horns to intimidate predators and scare prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"全身が かなり 温かい。 ツノの先から 炎を 出し 天敵や 獲物を 威嚇する。"}],"varieties":[{"id":636,"moves":[{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[11,"level-up",20],[14,"level-up",20],[15,"level-up",20],[16,"level-up",20],[17,"level-up",20],[18,"level-up",20],[20,"level-up",48],[25,"level-up",48],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[11,"level-up",90],[14,"level-up",90],[15,"level-up",90],[16,"level-up",90],[17,"level-up",90],[18,"level-up",90],[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]}